[{"title":"三贤堂","author":"徐恢","text":"六井犹存记，三贤尚有堂。\n地连金色界，庙接水仙王。\n市井空陈迹，杉松只旧行。\n唯公识真意，此处酒难忘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53546,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"会故人二首 其二","author":"徐恢","text":"毛郎才涌似潮头，莫比寒虫泣夜秋。\n要上兰台揖班马，不联石鼎玩侯刘。\n定知有道能医国，稍喜谈禅勘赵州。\n顾我虽无陶谢手，尚堪述作与同游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53547,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"会故人二首 其一","author":"徐恢","text":"江南江北每淹留，懒听寒蝉噪暮秋。\n句里岂能窥鲍谢，暗中聊解识曹刘。\n清如老鹤翻秋露，快似神驹略九州。\n只恐蛟龙得云雨，未容莲社与僧游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53548,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"灯夕多为城中之约因赋此篇","author":"徐恢","text":"春来懒倦半相仍，全似诸方怕事僧。\n薄有篇章堪对酒，略无情绪要观灯。\n湖山帝里梦频往，泉石吴乡归未能。\n四海平生几兄弟，个般滋味更谁曾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53549,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"临川洪守游南湖命予赋诗","author":"徐恢","text":"芙蓉堂前春水绿，芙蓉堂后春花开。\n芙蓉堂中醉歌舞，芙蓉堂下车如雷。\n轻舟弄水买一笑，游人竞逐墙阴来。\n浪痕不受尘滓涴，东风吹入黄金杯。\n鞦韆欲上綵绳稳，老翁稚子连声催。\n遨头春思浓似酒，剧饮谁能问升斗。\n博山香软珠帘低，坐客请行时被肘。\n觥筹交错兴未已，更著山殽并野蔌。\n归来门巷影散乱，舍南舍北黄埃走。\n轻衫短帽亦不恶，追欢岂落醉翁后。\n小姬顾盼扬秋波，十十五五细马驮。\n红旗夹道映斜日，金钗坠处肩相摩。\n旁观定自双眼饱，但见两脸生微涡。\n从今湖上愈清好，纤腰长袖成奔梭。\n冥搜付与纸上语，朱颜为我商声歌。\n愿公归侍玉皇侧，更向西湖弄春色。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53550,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游处州石门洞赋长句二十韵","author":"徐恢","text":"我闻石洞今几年，一朝来系秋风船。\n大船膀肛小船远，渔舟替涉幽涧泉。\n拖舟上上抵砂砾，更与略彴相夤缘。\n黄冠道士衣翩翩，殷勤为我临涧边。\n相逢一笑挽登岸，忽见珍馆罗修椽。\n谢公旧隐无处问，洗眼但看山中篇。\n佳哉南国典刑在，大羹遗味朱丝弦。\n当是发兴岂神助，两峰对面搀青天。\n主人掉头谓不尔，尚能飞瀑千仞悬。\n杖筇西下取微径，其境过清神凛然。\n初疑穷冬蕴积雪，惊飙拥下阴崖巅。\n又疑冰绡挂林杪，薄暮缥缈摇轻烟。\n蔽空乍觉微雨集，堕地复作跳珠圆。\n谢公得尔句偏好，我今其忍相弃捐。\n山奇水怪世莫测，神龙定自藏九渊。\n龙兮汝能水下土，胡为懒惰贪昼眠。\n自淮以北皆故壤，犬羊烂熳疆域膻。\n挽河莫假壮士力，奔雷走电一洗湔。\n我诗虽乏漫郎语，强颜犹可供磨镌。\n为君他日落此笔，千秋万岁令人传。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53551,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蒙刘元中数示东坡诗","author":"徐恢","text":"无邪公文天所赞，汩汩词源倒河汉。\n一篇新出纸为贵，万国争传金可换。\n晚节投荒无芥蒂，毕景著书自娱玩。\n天之所宝雷电取，渠不爱惜风雨散。\n两河漕僚真好事，五筦遗文尽堆案。\n似闻倾盖剧推许，亲以削牍定真赝。\n分传饷我枉银钩，贫室骤惊满珠贯。\n无坫共推玉界尺，争求当置铁门限。\n世人不识蔡伯喈，欲问图书觅王粲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53552,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"徐昭然","text":"精一危微共一心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53553,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"最高楼 寿七十","author":"徐架阁","text":"年高德劭，休叹老而传。\n纵白发，尚红颜。\n楚丘且谓吾始壮，大致仕亦宜然。\n更尊荣，安富贵，寿绵延。\n闻道生辰当月吉，万福千祥降自天。\n献春酒，展华筵。\n从心奚止不逾矩，绛人彭祖信齐肩。\n更殷勤，加颂祷，等椿年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53554,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"徐某","text":"至诚感格合天意，露零青松真上瑞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53555,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"徐某","text":"仙台之阳石坛东，下有亭亭太古松。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53556,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"邑人张孝友亲殁庐墓六年有五色鸟集墓陇邑大夫张公侃旌其庐名其乡曰移风乡","author":"徐洪","text":"孝友闻张仲，贻谋直到今。\n六年枯血泪，五色集祥禽。\n表此励颓俗，来兹生孝心。\n移风名不忝，茂宰意良深。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53557,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谒金门 其二","author":"徐珌","text":"春欲半。\n重到寂寥山馆。\n修竹连山青不断。\n谁家门可款。\n红晕花梢未半。\n绿蘸柳芽犹短。\n金缕香消春不管。\n素蟾光又满。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53558,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谒金门 其一 题沅州幽兰铺壁","author":"徐珌","text":"秋欲暮。\n路入乱山深处。\n扑面西风吹雾雨。\n驿亭欣暂驻。\n可惜国香风度。\n空谷寂寥谁顾。\n已作竹枝传楚女。\n客愁推不去。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53559,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游洞霄","author":"徐珏","text":"凡世纤尘不敢侵，瑶关自锁白云深。\n地灵佳木有仙意，山静啼禽多好音。\n五洞暗通蓬岛路，九峰密拱石坛阴。\n步虚声了幽人暇，一穟炉香三弄琴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53560,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题明皇","author":"徐秋云","text":"太平风月属三郎，羯鼓声高思转长。\n天子锦缠娱虢国，贵妃音律教宁王。\n人归巫峡山容在，花落温泉水更香。\n谁信蓬莱青鸟使，回来无语怨渔阳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53561,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"牡丹","author":"徐荣叟","text":"姚魏从来洛下誇，千金不惜买繁华。\n今年底事花能贱，缘是宫中不赏花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53562,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"茶","author":"徐荣叟","text":"官焙春绿入贡时，担头猎猎小黄旗。\n甘香不数尝阳羡，密侍天颜喜可知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53563,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠常庵江羽士","author":"徐荣叟","text":"曾跨金牛入帝乡，归装金薤富琳琅。\n唤回客枕邯郸梦，涧草岩花亦自香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53564,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题月山新居","author":"徐荣叟","text":"宠任辞枢极，新居卜月山。\n人从生处乐，天与老来闲。\n翠拥千峰秀，罗萦一水湾。\n佳哉得真乐，恨不早知还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53565,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"琼花","author":"徐荣叟","text":"琼甤走送宝瓶花，愧乏诗情用拜嘉。\n一种清香来月殿，十分雅态出仙家。\n细看后土春冰薄，未觉刘郎日影斜。\n拟跨胎禽尘几隔，珠帘十里自繁华。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53566,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"徐逊绵","text":"士死惟留姓与名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53567,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"儿宽","author":"徐钧","text":"射策明经亦巨儒，巧迎封禅意何如。\n相如未死犹知耻，却了相如死后书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53568,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"卜子夏","author":"徐钧","text":"宣尼生不到西河，圣化难沾觖望多。\n商也天教生独晚，为分一脉阐文科。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53569,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三晋","author":"徐钧","text":"二百年馀主夏盟，尊攘事业古无伦。\n若非剖一为三后，未必舆图尽入秦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53570,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"卫鞅","author":"徐钧","text":"心术刑名太刻残，网深文峻众心寒。\n仓忙客舍无归处，始悔当年法欠宽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53571,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山涛","author":"徐钧","text":"身心已逐竹林游，为国搜贤事却优。\n持正拟官觇上意，事君可作不忠谋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53572,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"马成","author":"徐钧","text":"保塞平淮亦效勤，当时佐命几元臣。\n不知谁紊云台次，却作中兴第二人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53573,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"马援","author":"徐钧","text":"还书万里诫诸郎，毁誉翻成误季良。\n说道谨言元不谨，谤招薏苡亦堪伤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53574,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"马融","author":"徐钧","text":"士迫饥寒已变初，权门宁免曳长裾。\n帐纱所学明何事，却陷忠良草奏书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53575,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元结","author":"徐钧","text":"漫劳当日牧舂陵，立石尤多感德民。\n独有磨崖碑故在，文章千古耀湘滨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53576,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元德秀","author":"徐钧","text":"山水光中寄一枝，琴尊尽日每相随。\n太平老去身何恨，只隔明年便乱离。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53577,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元稹","author":"徐钧","text":"元和诗体夙驰声，巧致公台只暂荣。\n绿野主人天下望，不应疏外负平生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53578,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"太子深","author":"徐钧","text":"擒虎临门事已休，独馀孺子不惊忧。\n阁中危坐能宣令，略洗双亲入井羞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53579,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"孔巢父","author":"徐钧","text":"力仗孤忠化积顽，奉辞竟不遣生还。\n何如入海随烟雾，自有诗留天地间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53580,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"孔稚圭","author":"徐钧","text":"草满门庭隐者家，却贪禄仕醉纷华。\n北山不用讥猿鹤，亦有人嘲两部蛙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53581,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"孔融","author":"徐钧","text":"客满尊中酒不空，眼高四海眇奸雄。\n才疏意广终无就，已兆清虚西晋风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53582,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"文君","author":"徐钧","text":"修眉横映远山青，却寄芳心一曲琴。\n可惜相如今病渴，薄情犹赋白头吟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53583,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"文宣洋","author":"徐钧","text":"奸谋远袭父兄基，一醉荒淫自盛衰。\n万古纲常俱扫地，独于临死未忘儿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53584,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"文帝","author":"徐钧","text":"倚女专朝旋篡位，因妃诉子竟戕身。\n兴亡反掌都缘色，枉作车书混一人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53585,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"文帝","author":"徐钧","text":"才输十倍德何如，窃位称尊启帝图。\n自料孔明非可敌，终身不敢瞰成都。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53586,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"牛弘","author":"徐钧","text":"射牛可怒理都然，三问何如一忍贤。\n底事妇言坚不听，为忧伤我弟兄天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53587,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"王戎","author":"徐钧","text":"清虚外托内营财，手运牙筹亦富哉。\n不料晋朝名位上，士风如是亦堪哀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53588,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"王宏","author":"徐钧","text":"乃翁江左辅中兴，忍助奸渠篡计成。\n黄菊白衣空送酒，可怜心事愧渊明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53589,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"王昭君","author":"徐钧","text":"画工虽巧岂堪凭，妍丑何如一见真。\n自是君王先错计，爱将耳目寄他人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53590,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"王烈","author":"徐钧","text":"窃牛尚恐彦方知，德化乡邦不拾遗。\n若使此风推四海，盗窥神鼎亦羞为。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53591,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"王祥","author":"徐钧","text":"卧冰得鲤供亲养，至孝诚能上格天。\n每信天人常吻合，应知容谷响声传。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53592,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"王通","author":"徐钧","text":"太平十二策空陈，得似河汾讲道真。\n缕指隋唐名将相，多君交友与门人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53593,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"王陵","author":"徐钧","text":"抗议争封独犯颜，周陈只合共持难。\n若能坚守长陵约，不但刘安吕亦安。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53594,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"王梁","author":"徐钧","text":"台辅尊贤匪报功，况因符命策司空。\n平生只为耽言谶，待此登庸恐未公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53595,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"王维","author":"徐钧","text":"凝碧池头听乐府，不能身死但能悲。\n辋川他日成名胜，藉得朝天一首诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53596,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"王羲之","author":"徐钧","text":"人物风流世所推，操持议论每清奇。\n自量才位难牟弟，故乞馀年请代之。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53597,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"王霸","author":"徐钧","text":"寇迫兵单路已穷，河冰偶合片言中。\n但令有道蒙天助，阻水犹图背水功。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53598,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"邓禹","author":"徐钧","text":"久从游学识英雄，杖策南来见略同。\n首建雄谋恢汉业，云台端合议元功。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53599,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"韦贤子元成","author":"徐钧","text":"遗金何得似传经，爵让难兄风感深。\n卒使淮阳谋遂寝，潜消一点废储心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53600,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"韦皋","author":"徐钧","text":"抚边年久赋徭宽，善政春秋俗自安。\n蜀道虽危今坦易，登天不比向时难。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53601,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东平宪王苍","author":"徐钧","text":"重修礼乐佐文明，乐善终能保令名。\n两汉贤王谁与并，河间以后便东平。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53602,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"乐毅","author":"徐钧","text":"七十城收一笑间，对时气势擅强燕。\n区区莒墨何难下，自是君王不永年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53603,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"冯异","author":"徐钧","text":"旧是起兵时主簿，今为大树下将军。\n若看劝帝施恩语，俣独区区战伐勋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53604,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"卢仝","author":"徐钧","text":"数间破屋洛城傍，门闭春风煮茗香。\n月蚀一诗讥逆党，添丁奇祸竟堪伤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53605,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"卢怀慎","author":"徐钧","text":"曹参尚守萧何法，鲍叔惭分管仲权。\n莫笑当时呼伴食，元之秉国恐妨贤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53606,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"卢藏用","author":"徐钧","text":"托隐终南得美除，何期触网仅全躯。\n此中佳处今休道，捷径元来是畏途。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53607,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古弼","author":"徐钧","text":"请田戎猎凛英风，万乘犹知畏笔公。\n晚节不容非老秃，世无明主曷知忠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53608,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"史万岁","author":"徐钧","text":"征南轻仆孔明碑，想见生平暴可知。\n一死虽因奸计陷，亦由廷辩忿招疑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53609,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"司马相如","author":"徐钧","text":"卖赋名成卖酒馀，归来驷马拥高车。\n锦衣只欲湔前耻，不道开边困里闾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53610,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"四皓","author":"徐钧","text":"避乱商山且茹之，遽因厚币起幽栖。\n母强子弱几危汉，悔杀先生一出低。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53611,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"平原君","author":"徐钧","text":"谢躄虽云礼意恭，平生结客竟何功。\n不知他日邯郸警，独有捐躯一李同。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53612,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"汉高祖","author":"徐钧","text":"商后誓师因亳众，周王致业述豳风。\n不阶尺土一人柄，谁似皮冠一沛公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53613,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"田子方","author":"徐钧","text":"君侯坐问所从谁，极口惟谈顺子奇。\n可叹今人多不让，始知无择解称师。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53614,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"田单","author":"徐钧","text":"鼓噪奔牛亦壮哉，一城力挽众城回。\n谁知辟士明封赏，即墨曾经培养来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53615,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"申不害","author":"徐钧","text":"相国终身保治平，不同非鞅死刑名。\n只缘用志能卑逊，纵曰伤残亦觉轻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53616,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"白起","author":"徐钧","text":"投降赵卒本求生，坑后谁人不死争。\n三召三辞宁自刎，邯郸料不再长平。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53617,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"边韶","author":"徐钧","text":"寸晷分阴闲可惜，粪墙朽木责非苛。\n便便书腹贪眠昼，免得诸生笑诮么。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53618,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"乔知之","author":"徐钧","text":"绿珠诗作怨方新，往事尤当监季伦。\n赴井已迟徒累主，真标那似堕楼人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53619,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]